              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حرف او ثابت شد. harf-e u sâbet shod. What she said was proven."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sâbet \"fixed, firm\" + shodan \"to become\" (present stem shav-). Sâbet kardan — to prove."
